+- `CLPR_QUEUE_BAD_ROUTE_ENVELOPE`
+- `CLPR_QUEUE_UNSUPPORTED_ROUTE_VERSION`
+- `CLPR_QUEUE_INVALID_REMOTE_LEDGER_ID`
+
+Translator unit tests cover:
